(* CALIBRATION 2 of 2 — this formula MUST evaluate to FALSE.

   The companion to 00_calibration_true.mcl. That one shows the notation can
   match; this one shows it can also FAIL to match, so a FALSE elsewhere in
   this directory carries information.

   A gate name that does not exist in the model. If this returns TRUE the
   checker is not doing what the formulas say, and nothing here is usable.

   Expected: FALSE
*)
< true* . "NO_SUCH_GATE_IN_THIS_MODEL" > true
